// Article 4. Sale of an interest.
#require "1-members.charter".
Placeholder seller For person
Placeholder buyer For person
Function offered Identified by seller * usd
Fact accepted Identified by buyer * seller
Act offer-interest Actor seller Related to usd
  Holds when member(seller)
  Creates offered()
Power accept-offer Actor buyer Recipient seller
  Holds when member(buyer) && buyer != seller
  Valid when member(buyer) && buyer != seller
    && (Exists offered: offered.seller == seller && Not(Held(offered) For 30))
  Creates accepted()
Power sell-to-members Actor seller
  Holds when member(seller)
  Valid when (Exists offered: offered.seller == seller && Held(offered) For 30)
    && (Exists buyer: accepted())
  Creates (Foreach capital: capital(capital.person, capital.int
              + MulDivRound(Sum(Foreach capital': capital'.int When capital'.person == seller), capital.int,
                            Sum(Foreach capital': capital'.int When accepted(capital'.person, seller)), Floor))
             When accepted(capital.person, seller))
        , capital(seller, 0)
  Terminates member(seller), (Foreach offered: offered When offered.seller == seller), (Foreach buyer: accepted())
Power sell-outside Actor seller Recipient buyer Related to usd
  Holds when member(seller)
  Valid when (Exists offered: offered.seller == seller && Held(offered) For 30 && usd >= offered.usd)
    && Not(Exists buyer': accepted(buyer', seller)) && member(buyer)
  Creates capital(buyer, Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int When capital.person == seller)), capital(seller, 0)
  Terminates member(seller), (Foreach offered: offered When offered.seller == seller)

Clause 4.1 Approved "af2564eb8d89be71efe06d9261b7de17e7dfeb3352711f3d0c978c2ef16275ef"
  Norm "A member who wants to sell an interest first offers it to the other members at the price a buyer is willing to pay." => offer-interest
Clause 4.2 Approved "c8d273143c76390267816e8c69751dca9b575a3a9cbeccf178e0695d15dcc708"
  Norm "The other members have thirty days from the offer to accept it." => accept-offer
  Norm " If both accept, they buy the interest in proportion to their percentage interests. If one accepts, that member buys all of it." => sell-to-members
Clause 4.3 Approved "06924e9fa49b86219beacea849faae72344b8040e1de2c4845729d147d07016f"
  Norm "If neither accepts within the thirty days, the member may sell the interest to the buyer for no less than the offered price, once the buyer has been admitted as a member." => sell-outside
Clause 4.4 Approved "d8aad4dcc1e26b07bf712bfdc4b75039975e1d52d63a7a2958f3e85e0de643d2"
  Norm "A sale of an interest that does not follow this article has no effect." => sell-to-members, sell-outside
.
